{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國有線新聞網絡（CNN）引述知情人士稱，於巴西總統大選落敗的前總統博索納羅之子弗拉維奧（Flávio Bolsonaro）已離國，於周二（27日）抵達美國，降落地點未明。</p><p>勝選連任總統的盧拉形容弗拉維奧離境「可恥」。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T05:22:43.791245+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T04:54:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T18:38:44.458032+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T05:18:17.032410+00:00","content_hash":"90421c66650d0d634394c81991a7d735e8fa2d903c8165ff9797a3fe90734ede","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}